गदसिंह<BR>		Anekārthadhvanimañjarī, vocabulary. He quotes<BR>Rudra, Gaṅgādhara, Dharaṇi, Ratnakośa. Cop.<BR>103. L. 746. He is quoted by Raghunandana.<BR>		Ūṣmaviveka. L. 351. Quoted by Ramānātha.<BR>		Tattvacandrikā Kirātārjunīyaṭīkā L. 2140. He<BR>quotes the C. by Prakāśavarṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-145,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

