गदाधर|गदाधरः
गदाधर son of Rāmeśvara, son of Vedeśvara, son of<BR>Caṇḍeśvara, was father of Vidyādhara, father of<BR>Ratnadhara, father of Jagaddhara (Mālatīmādhavaṭīkā,<BR>etc.). Oxf. 136^a. L. 1981.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-145,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

