दिब्राकर
दिब्राकर of Golagrāma, son of Bhaṭṭācārya, had five<BR>sons: Kṛṣṇa, Viṣṇu, Mallāri (Grahalāghavaṭīkā),<BR>Keśava and Viśvanātha (Keśavajātakapaddhatyudā-<BR>haraṇa). Kṛṣṇa was the father of Nṛsiṃha (Sūrya-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-253-b" target="_blank">Page1-253-b+ 48</a>]<BR>siddhāntavāsanābhāṣya), grandfather of Divākara.<BR>Cambr. 42. Oxf. 337^b. L. 1897. 2025.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-253,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

