निर्णयसिन्धु dh. composed by Kamalākara in 1616. IO.<BR>192. 193. 1888. Oxf. 277^b. Khn. 74. K. 182.<BR>B. 3, 100. Bik. 428. Kāṭm. 3. Rādh 18. Oudh<BR>XIII, 70. NP. II, 142. VII, 20. IX, 10. Burnell<BR>130^b. Poona 145. 150. 195. II, 201. Oppert 71.<BR>288. 803. 901. 1869. 3802. 3996. 4314. 6514. 6599.<BR>6749. 6932. 7327. 7608. 7759. 8040. II, 143. 344.<BR>524. 1900. 1978. 2601. 2832. 2942. 3510. 4311.<BR>4685. 5136. 6314. 7050. 7607. Rice 204. BP.<BR>298. SB. 134. Nirṇayapāda. Ben. 144. 145.<BR>Laghu and Bṛhat. Pheh 3. Quoted by Puruṣottama<BR>Oxf. 38^b, 274^a, and in Ācārārka.<BR>		C. Oppert 3803.<BR>		C. by Kṛṣṇa Bhaṭṭa Ārḍe. Hall p. 31. K. 182.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-298-b" target="_blank">Page1-298-b+ 47</a>]<BR>B. 3, 100. Burnell 130^b. Lahore 10. Oppert<BR>II, 8045 (Kṛṣṇāśrama).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-298,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

