प्रेमनिधिपन्थ
प्रेमनिधि पन्थ son of Umāpati:<BR>		Antaryāgaratna.<BR>		Kāmyadīpadānapaddhati.<BR>		Ghṛtadānapaddhati.<BR>		Tantrarājaṭīkā Sudarśanā.<BR>		Dīpadānaratna.<BR>		Dīpaprakāśa and its C. Śabdaprakāśa (written in<BR>1755).<BR>		Prayogaratna.<BR>		Prayogaratnakroḍa.<BR>		Prayogaratnasaṃskāra.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-365-a" target="_blank">Page1-365-a+ 47</a>]<BR>		Prayogaratnākara.<BR>		Bahiryāgaratna.<BR>		Bhaktavrātasaṃtoṣaka.<BR>		Bhaktitaraṅgiṇī.<BR>		Mallādarśa.<BR>		Mūlaprakāśa (?). K. 48. Most likely, the C. to<BR>the Dīpaprakāśa.<BR>		Lavaṇadānaratna.<BR>		Śaktisaṃgamatantra, i. e. its C., as the principal<BR>work dates much carlier.<BR>		Śabdārthacintāmaṇi Śāradātilakaṭīkā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-364,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

