कोलाचल मल्लिनाथ provincially called Peḍḍa Bhaṭṭa,<BR>father of Kumārasvāmin and Viśveśvara. He is<BR>quoted in the Bhojaprabandha Oxf. 150^b:<BR>		Amarapadapārijāta Amarakośaṭīkā.<BR>		Udārakāvya (?).<BR>		Ekāvalīṭīkā Tarala.<BR>		Kirātārjunīyaṭīkā Ghaṇṭāpatha.<BR>		Kumārasambhavaṭīkā Saṃjīvanī.<BR>		Tārkikarakṣāṭīkā Niṣkaṇṭikā.<BR>		Naiṣadhīyaṭīkā Jīvātu.<BR>		Bhaṭṭikāvyaṭīkā.<BR>		Meghadūtaṭīkā Saṃjīvanī.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-434-b" target="_blank">Page1-434-b+ 47</a>]<BR>		Raghuvaṃśaṭīkā Saṃjīvanī.<BR>		Raghuvīracarita.<BR>		Śiśupālavadhaṭīkā Sarvaṃkaṣā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-434,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

