महीधर|महीधरः
महीधर son of Rāmabhakta, grandson of Ratnākara,<BR>pupil of Ratneśvara, a son of Keśava, lived at Benares:<BR>		Adbhutaviveka.<BR>		Īśāvāsyopaniṣadbhāṣya.<BR>		Ekākṣarakośa.<BR>		Kātyāyanagṛhyasūtrabhāṣya.<BR>		Kātyāyanaśulbasūtrabhāṣya.<BR>		Nṛsiṃhapaṭala.<BR>		Puruṣasūktaṭīkā.<BR>		Mantramahodadhi and its C. Nauka, written in 1589.<BR>		Mātṛkākṣaranighaṇṭu or Mātṛkānighaṇṭu.<BR>		Yogavāsiṣṭhasāravivṛti.<BR>		Rāmagītāṭīkā.<BR>		Rudrajapabhāṣya.<BR>		Viṣṇubhaktikalpalatāprakāśa, written in 1597.<BR>		Vedadīpa on Vājasaneyisaṃhitā.<BR>		Ṣaḍaṅgarudrabhāṣya.<BR>		Sārasvataprakriyāṭīkā.<BR>		Sautrāmaṇīviniyogasūtrārtha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-444,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

