मीमांसा
मीमांसा consists of two kinds. The first called Pūrva-<BR>mīmāṃsā, Karmamīmāṃsā, Dharmamīmāṃsā, Bhāṭṭa,<BR>is based on the Jaiminisūtra. The second Uttara-<BR>mīmāṃsā, Vedānta, rests on the authority of the<BR>Brahmasūtra by Bādarāyaṇa. The following works<BR>belong only to the Pūrvamīmāṃsā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-456,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

