राजशेखर|राजशेखरः
राजशेखर son of Durduka and Śīlavatī, tutor to Ma-<BR>hendrapāla, king of Kanyakubjā (inscriptions of 903<BR>and 907) wrote 4 plays:<BR>		Karpūramañjarī.<BR>		Pracaṇḍapāṇḍava or Bālabhārata.<BR>		Bālarāmāyaṇa.<BR>		Viddhaśālabhañjikā.<BR>		In the introduction to the Bālarāmāyaṇa he speaks<BR>of 6 works of his. Verses of his are quoted<BR>by Kṣemendra, Maṅkha, Śp. p. 77, Skm.<BR>(where he is mentioned by Abhinanda as a<BR>contemporary, and by Vasukalpa), Sbhv. in<BR>Sarasvatīkaṇṭhābharaṇa, Gaṇaratnamahodadhi.<BR>See Saṃkṣepaśaṅkarajaya Oxf. 255. 258^a.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-502,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

