राम|रामं|रामः
राम son of Ananta, grandson of Cintāmaṇi, younger<BR>brother of Nīlakaṇṭha:<BR>		Muhūrtacintāmaṇi and its C. Pramitākṣarā, com-<BR>posed at Benares in 1601.<BR>		Rāmavinoda or Rāmavinodakaraṇa or Pañcāṅga-<BR>sādhanodāharaṇa, composed in 1614.<BR>		<i>Whether the following works were writ en by the same</i><BR><i>author is uncertain.</i><BR>		Karaṇakesarin.<BR>		Yavanīyaramalaśāstra.<BR>		Ramalapaddhati.<BR>		Ramalaśāstra.<BR>		Laghupaddhati.<BR>		Samarasāra<BR>		Samarasārasvarodaya.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-507-a" target="_blank">Page1-507-a+ 48</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-506,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

