रामचन्द्रभट्ट
रामचन्द्र भट्ट younger brother of Nīlakaṇṭha, son of<BR>Ānanta Bhaṭṭa, composed by order of Rāmadāsa,<BR>minister of Akbar, in 1614:<BR>		Rāmavinodakaraṇa or Pañcāṅgasādhanodāharaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-512,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

