रामचन्द्र son of Kṛṣṇa, son of Nṛhari, son of Anantā-<BR>cārya, pupil of Gopāla, father of Nṛsiṃha, father<BR>of Viṭṭhala, father of Lakṣmīdhara, father of Ananta:<BR>		Tithinirṇayasaṃgraha or Anantabhaṭṭadīpikā, an<BR>epitome of Anantopādhyāya's Tithinirṇaya.<BR>		Prakriyākaumudī.<BR>		Vaiṣṇavasiddhāntadīpikā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-512,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

