वामन|वामनः
वामन poet, a minister under Jayāpīḍa. Rājataraṅgiṇī<BR>4, 496. Verses of his are given in Skm. Sbhv.<BR>He is quoted by Kṣīrasvāmin, Abhinavagupta, Vardha-<BR>māna, by Sāyaṇa (both as a grammarian and a writer<BR>on poetics) in the Dhātuvṛtti, and a host of others:<BR>		Aviśrāntavidyādharavyākaraṇa.<BR>		Kāvyālaṃkārasūtra and vṛtti.<BR>		Kāśikāvṛtti partly.<BR>		Whether the Sūtrapāṭha, Uṇādisūtra, Liṅgasūtra<BR>belong to the same Vāmaṇa is by no means<BR>certain. Peters. 3, 40^a. 111. He quotes the<BR>Pañjikā and Jainendra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-563,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

