विट्ठलआचार्य
विट्ठल आचार्य son of Nṛsiṃhācārya, grandson of Rāma-<BR>kṛṣṇācārya, father of Lakṣmīdharācārya. As a<BR>grammarian he is disparaged by Bhaṭṭoji:<BR>		Prakriyākaumudīprasāda.<BR>		Avyayārthanirūpaṇa.<BR>		Vaiṣṇavasiddhāntadīpikāṭīkā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-572,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

