rapūrvapakṣagranthaṭīkā. NP. II, 28.<BR>		Sāmānyaniruktikroḍa. Oppert II, 3832. 3885.<BR>		Sāmānyaniruktiṭīkā. NP. II, 44. Oppert II, 8980.<BR>		Sāmānyaniruktipattra. Oppert II, 8789.<BR>		Sāmānyalakṣaṇaṭīkā. NP. II, 16.<BR>		Hetulakṣaṇaṭīkā. NP. II, 38.<BR>		Śaṅkarapattra ny. Oppert 210. 376. 484. II, 8958.<BR>Rice 120.<BR>		Śaṅkarabhaṭṭīya ny. Oppert 1327. 3227. 4358<BR>5401. II, 666. 3832. 4246. 10261. Rice 120.<BR>		Śāṅkarī ny. Oppert 7787. II, 2103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-625,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

