शरभोजि
शरभोजि king of Tanjore. Born in 1778 (his Jātaka<BR>is mentioned Burnell 80^a), he ruled 1798--1833.<BR>The following works are attributed to him:<BR>		Rāghavacaritra.<BR>		Vyavahāraprakāśa.<BR>		Vyavahārārthasmṛtisārasamuccaya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-637,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

