dra, composed in 1710 (?). Hall p. 174.<BR>L. 2457. Ben. 89. 103. 106. 107. 109. 111.<BR>112. 115. 117. 119--22. 125. 129. Oudh<BR>XVIII, 68. NP. I, 46. 48. 132.<BR>		C. by Śaṅkara Bhaṭṭa, son of Nārāyaṇa Bhaṭṭa.<BR>Hall p. 177. L. 2359 (fr.). Ben. 121. Rice 180.<BR>		C. by Śrīnātha. Oppert 8290.<BR>		C. Mayūkhamālikā by Somanātha Bhaṭṭa. IO. 1111.<BR>Hall p. 176. Khn. 54 (fr.). 84. K. 110. Ben.<BR>88--90. 97. 100. 109. 112--15. 123--26.<BR>Oudh XIII, 82. NP. I, 132. V, 98. IX, 28.<BR>X, 30. Burnell 83^a. Lahore 18. Taylor<BR>1, 261. Oppert 715. 1529. 1606. 1607. 1966.<BR>1967. 1989. 2399. 3040. 3827. 3834. 5817.<BR>II, 1643. 2966. 4365. 4828. 4829. 5405. 5542.<BR>5865. 7695. 7697. 7793. 9427. Rice 126.<BR>128. Bühler 556. The stray sheep Somama-<BR>yūkha Khn. 54 belongs also to this flock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-644,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

