संगीतरत्नाकर
संगीतरत्नाकर by Śārṅgadeva. It consists of seven chapters<BR>1) Svaragatādhyāya (Oxf. 199^b). 2) Rāgavivekādhyāya<BR>(Oxf. ibid.). 3) Prakīrṇakādhyāya (Tüb. 19). 4) Pra-<BR>bandhādhyāya (Oxf. ibid.). 5) Tālādhyāya (Oxf. ibid.<BR>NP. III, 86). 6) Vādyādhyāya (Ben. 33. NP. III, 86).<BR>7) Nṛttādhyāya (IO. 1503. Oxf. 199^b. B. 4, 274).<BR>--IO. 2383. 3000. B. 4, 274. Ben. 33. Bik. 522<BR>--25. Rādh 38. NP. III, 86 (fr.). Burnell 59^b.<BR>Bhr. 407 (1--4). Oppert 1174. 2089. 2726. 3038.<BR>3063. 4647. 5693. 7436. 8314. Quoted by Rāmā-<BR>nanda Oxf. 72^b, by Mallinātha Oxf. 126^a, by Dāmo-<BR>dara Oxf. 201^a, by Soma Oxf. 200^b.<BR>		C. Bik. 525.<BR>		C. Candrikā. Oppert 6258.<BR>		C. Kalānidhi by Kalinātha. B. 4, 274. Bik. 526.<BR>Burnell 59^b. Oppert 8315. BP. 276. Sūcī-<BR>pattra 74. Quoted Oxf. 72^b. 201^a.<BR>		C. Saṃgītasudhākara by Siṅgabhūpāla NW. 612<BR>(Siṃhabhūpāla). Bhr. 406. p. 222. Sūcīpattra<BR>74 (Siṃhabhūpāla).<BR>		C. by Haṃsagopāla. B. 4, 274.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-686,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

