समरसिंह
समरसिंह of the Prāgvāṭavaṃśa, son of Kumārasiṃha, son<BR>of Sāmanta, son of Śobhanadeva, son of Candrasiṃha,<BR>who was minister of one of the Cālukya princes of<BR>Gujarat. Bhr. p. 32. He is quoted in the Hāyana-<BR>ratna W. p. 265:<BR>		Jagadbhūṣaṇakoṣṭhaka.<BR>		Tājikatantra.<BR>		Tājikatantrasāra or Gaṇakabhūṣaṇa or Karma-<BR>prakāśa.<BR>		Tājikasiddhānta.<BR>		Manuṣyajātaka.<BR>		Varṣacaryāvarṇana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-697,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

