सर्वज्ञ|सर्व्वज्ञ|सर्व्वज्ञः
सर्वज्ञ king of Karṇāṭa, had a son Aniruddhadeva, who<BR>was father of Rūpeśvara and Harihara. Rūpeśvara's<BR>son Padmanābha had five sons, Puruṣottama, Ja-<BR>gannātha, Nārāyaṇa, Murāri, Mukunda. The last of<BR>these had one son, Kumāra, whose three sons were<BR>Sanātana, Rūpa and Vallabha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-701,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

