P. II, 96.<BR>X, 44. Burnell 40^a. P. 3. Oppert 270. 698.<BR>701. 835--37. 990. 1444. 1445. 1839. 2235.<BR>2236. 2508. 2608. 2838. 3303. 3529. 3718.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-718-b" target="_blank">Page1-718-b+ 48</a>]<BR>4141. 4297. 4477. 4838. 4859. 5049. 5376.<BR>5719. 5983. 6344. 6585. 6906. 7308. 7756.<BR>7968. II, 688. 752. 812. 933. 1074. 1322.<BR>1754. 2048. 2246. 2295. 2386. 2656. 2720.<BR>2765. 2933. 3050. 4411. 4618. 5384. 5620.<BR>5742. 6117. 6276. 6500. 6665. 6759. 6984.<BR>7379. 7565. 8640. 8849. 9031. 9246. 9345.<BR>9462. 9816. 10081. 10136. 10225. 10313.<BR>10398. Rice 14. 16.<BR>		C. Sumanoramā by Tirumala. Burnell 40^b. Oppert<BR>4153. II, 719. 7841.<BR>		C. by Bhaṭṭoji (?). Oppert II, 4543. See Prau-<BR>ḍhamanoramā.<BR>		C. Siddhāntakaumudīvilāsa by Bhāskararāya. K.<BR>90. Ben. 23. Rādh 10. Oudh. XI, 8. NP.<BR>II, 94. Lahore 6.<BR>		C. Vaiyākaraṇasiddhāntaratnākara by Rāmakṛṣṇa<BR>Bhaṭṭa, son of Tirumala. L. 705 (fr.). K. 90.<BR>B. 3, 30. Ben. 19, 22. Lgr. 155. Rādh<BR>9. 10. NW. 46 (samāsa). 68 (kāraka). Oudh<BR>III, 12. NP. I, 102 (kāraka). II, 96. Burnell<BR>40^a. Lahore 6. Bhr. 189. Oppert II, 4964.<BR>7003. W. 1628 (fr.). Peters. 3, 393.<BR>		CC. Siddhāntaratnākarapradīpa. Rādh 10.<BR>		C. by Viśveśvaratīrtha. NW. 40. NP. I, 108.<BR>		C. Siddhāntaratnākara by Śivarāmendra Sarasvatī.<BR>NP. II, 96.<BR>		C. by Hari Dīkṣita. NW. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-718,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

