सूर्यकवि
सूर्य कवि or सूर्य सूरि or सूर्य पण्डित or सूर्यदास son<BR>of Jñānarāja Paṇḍita, grandson of Nāganātha, an in-<BR>habitant of Pārthapura. His full pedigree is given<BR>under Rāma p. 505^b:<BR>		Kavikalpalatāṭīkā Bālabodhikā.<BR>		Gaṇitamālatī.<BR>		Gaṇitāmṛtakūpikā Līlāvatīṭīkā, composed in 1542.<BR>		Grahavinoda.<BR>		Tājikālaṃkāra or Bodhasudhākara.<BR>		Nṛsiṃhacampū.<BR>		Paramārthaprapā Bhagavadgītāṭīkā.<BR>		Bhaktiśata.<BR>		Rāmakṛṣṇavilomakāvya.<BR>		Vedāntaśataślokīṭīkā.<BR>		Śṛṅgārataraṅgiṇī Amaruśatakaṭīkā.<BR>		Siddhāntaśiromaṇiṭīkā.<BR>		Siddhāntasaṃhitāsārasamuccaya.<BR>		Sūryaprakāśa on Bhāskara's Bījagaṇita.<BR>		Sūryabhaṭṭīya jy. Oppert 6282.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-731,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

