हरिदास a relative of Viṭṭhaleśvara, wrote a great<BR>number of tracts on bhakti:<BR>		Aiśvaryavivaraṇa.<BR>		Kāmākhyadoṣavivaraṇa.<BR>		Ṭippaṇyāśaya.<BR>		Navaratnaprakāśa, a C. on Vallabhācārya's Na-<BR>varatna.<BR>		Nirodhalakṣaṇavivṛti.<BR>		Bhaktimārganirūpaṇa.<BR>		Bhaktivivṛddhyupāyagrantha.<BR>		Viṣṇubhaktivivaraṇa.<BR>		Vedāntasiddhāntakaumudī.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-757-b" target="_blank">Page1-757-b+ 47</a>]<BR>		Śrutikalpadruma.<BR>		Ślokapañcakavivaraṇa.<BR>		Siddhāntarahasyavṛttikārikā.<BR>		Sevanabhāvanākāvya.<BR>		Sevāphalastotravivṛti.<BR>		Svamārgamarmavivaraṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-757,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

