भागवतपुराण
भागवतपुराण Since this was penned, I have found two<BR>other passages in Hemādri which are taken from<BR>the present Bhāgavatapurāṇa. In my own opinion,<BR>this Purāṇa was made up, at a comparatively recent<BR>period, from the disjecta membra of legends con-<BR>cerning Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=1-793,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

