केशवार्क
केशवार्क or केशवादित्य son of Rāṇiga, is the author<BR>of the Karaṇakaṇṭhīrava, the Kṛṣṇakrīḍita, Brahma-<BR>tulyagaṇitasāra, Vivāhavṛndāvana and C.<BR>.--The<BR>Jātakapaddhati or Keśavī, the Tājikapaddhati and<BR>the Muhūrtatattva belong to Keśava, son of Kama-<BR>lākara. The remaining works are composed by some<BR>Keśava, who is not distinguished from others in<BR>the Lists from which they were given.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=2-025,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

