नीलकण्ठ son of Ananta, grandson of Cintāmaṇi. He<BR>was father of Govinda, grandfather of Ananta, Cintā-<BR>maṇi and Mādhava (Tājikaṭīkā). He composed his<BR>Tājika in 1587.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=2-065,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलकण्ठसूरि
नीलकण्ठ सूरि of the Caturdhara family, son of Govinda<BR>Sūri:<BR>		Gaṇeśagītāṭīkā. composed in 1694.<BR>		Śivatāṇḍavavyākhyā, composed in 1681.<BR>		Saurapaurāṇikamatasamarthana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=2-065,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

