55 (inc.).<BR>		Siddhāntalakṣaṇa. CS 3, 230 (fr.). 250. 251 (fr.).<BR>253--255 (inc.). 258. 261. 486. 489. 491 (fr.).<BR>492 (fr.).<BR>		Hetvābhāsa. CS 3, 267 (inc.). 516 (inc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=3-042,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

