पद्मनाभदत्त
पद्मनाभदत्त the author of the Supadma Grammar,<BR>composed the Pṛṣodarādivṛtti in 1367. In his<BR>Paribhāṣāvṛtti (IO. No. 890) he mentions the follow-<BR>ing works of his: 1) Supadma Grammar and Pañjikā.<BR>2) Prayogadīpikā. 3) Uṇādivṛtti. 4) Dhātukaumudī.<BR>5) Yaṅlugvṛtti. 6) Gopālacarita. 7) Ānandalaharī-<BR>ṭīkā. 8) Śiśupālavadhaṭīkā. 9) Chandoratna. 10) Ācāra-<BR>candrikā. 11) Bhūriprayoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=3-069,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

