82 F.<BR>		--Vṛndāvanamāhātmya from the Pātālakhaṇḍa.<BR>CS 4, 42 (inc.).<BR>		--Vedasārasahasranāman. IO. 239.<BR>		--Vaidyanāthamāhātmya. AS p. 186.<BR>		--Vaiśākhamāhātmya from the Pātālakhaṇḍa.<BR>Lz. 226--228.<BR>		--Śivagītā q. v.<BR>		--Śivarāghavasaṃvāda. CS 4, 41. IO. 2564.<BR>		--Śivasahasranāman. Peters. 5, 199.<BR>		--Śvetagirimāhātmya. IO. 2838.<BR>		--Saṃkaṣṭanāśanastotra. Cr.<BR>		--Saphalā Kṛṣṇaikādaśī Pauṣī. Lz. 352, 3.<BR>		--Holikāmāhātmya from the Pātālakhaṇḍa. CS<BR>4, 262. IO. 846. 1828.<BR>		Padmapurāṇakhila (?). IO. 2565.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=3-069,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

