शतपथब्राह्मण
शतपथब्राह्मण Bd. 46 (inc.). Name not stated.<BR>1) Haviryajña. Bd. 42--45. Lz. 51 (1, 1, 3 till<BR>9, 3, 21). 52 (till 1, 6, 3, 41). Peters. 5, 58<BR>.--Eka-<BR>pādikā. Bd. 42--45. Peters. 5, 59. --3) Adhvara.<BR>Bd. 42--45. Peters. 5, 60<BR>.--4) Graha. AS p. 193<BR>(2 MSS.). Bd. 42--44. 45 (inc.). --5) Sava. Bd.<BR>45 (inc.). Peters. 5, 61. --6) Ukhāsambharaṇa.<BR>Peters. 5, 62. --7) Hastighaṭa wanting. 8) Citi.<BR>Peters. 5, 63. --9) Saṃciti. Peters. 5, 64. --<BR>10) Agnirahasya. Peters. 5, 65. C. by Sāyaṇa.<BR>Peters. 6, 1<BR>.--11) Aṣṭādhyāyī. AS p. 193 (2 MSS.).<BR>--12) Madhyama. Peters. 5, 66. 13) Aśvamedha.<BR>AS p. 193. Peters. 5, 67. --14) Āraṇyaka. Lz. 53<BR>(14, 1, 1, 6 up to the end). 54 (from the beginning<BR>to the end of the second Prapāṭhaka). Peters. 5, 68.<BR>69 (inc.).<BR><i>Kāṇvaśākhā.</i> (All the MSS. from AS p. 193).<BR>1) Ekapādikā. 2) Havyakāṇḍa. 3) Uddhāri. 4) Adhvara.<BR>5) Graha. 6) Vājapeya. 7) Rājasūya. 8) Ukhāsam-<BR>bharaṇa. 9) Hastighaṭa. 10) Citi (2 MSS., the second<BR>inc.). 11) Saṃciti (2 MSS., the second inc.). 12) Agni-<BR>rahasya. 13) Aṣṭādhyāyī, called Uddālakakhaṇḍa.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=3-131-b" target="_blank">Page3-131-b+ 47</a>]<BR>14) Madhyama (2 MSS.). 15) Aśvamedha. --Khila-<BR>khaṇḍa a part of the Bṛhadāraṇyaka.<BR>		C. Vedārthadīpikā by Anantācārya (only on Aṣṭā-<BR>dhyāyī). AS p. 193.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=ACC&page=3-131,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=acc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

